{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1882095958"}, "name":{"label":"Ddidit2"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-21T19:52:42-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"168"}, "id":{"label":"13661375979"}, "title":{"label":"Scam- Don’t buy ts"}, "content":{"label":"Don’t buy the lifetime subscription. When I first bought the subscription it took me to a different page which was then asking me to buy ANOTHER Subscription for $20 a month and when i refused to purchase the second subscription, it took me back to the paywall as if I had never bought anything. Me, being stupid, bought the lifetime subscription again to see if it would work this time. Nope. Except the second time it didn’t even ask me to buy a second subscription or redirect me anywhere, it just stayed on the same page. So there’s $100 down the drain", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
