{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1882073595"}, "name":{"label":"Thomast7"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-21T18:10:28-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"168"}, "id":{"label":"13661132614"}, "title":{"label":"Bugs bugs bugs"}, "content":{"label":"Good app overall but has a lot of bugs for such an expensive subscription. On the iPad the “progress” section doesn’t show up right, the mood log doesn’t keep what you put in it, and the life tree is a side window you cannot see fully. The days clean and relapse sections are different on different pages too. \n\nFor $30 the app is kinda a scam ngl. Needs major upgrades. I also wish it was compatible with devices with different Apple IDs. You could limit the device total but make QUITTR have its own log on separate from Apple ID", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
