{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1072683464"}, "name":{"label":"Jonathan1799"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-21T11:37:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"168"}, "id":{"label":"13660134654"}, "title":{"label":"App is great to stay accountable/  customer support is awful"}, "content":{"label":"I downloaded the app because of a Christian TikToker shared the app, I downloaded it and purchased the lifetime access . After I had access and started to get myself set up within the app. After three days the app completely booted me off and was asking for payment again before I could access my.  I reached out to support and apple to get a refund and after it being denied once and then twice because it didn’t qualify for a refund. I was able to get some conversation with support yet they mentioned to me that they’re working on the app to fix the problem.   I emailed multiple times and no clear answer on how my lifetime subscription is not in my subscription tab in my settings. \n\nCurrently waiting for support to resolve this issue so I may get my progress back and make sure that my lifetime subscription is active and in the subscription tab in settings. \n\nThe app is great to keep accountable. No great customer support.  Response time is 2/10. \n\nI will update this once issues are resolved.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
