{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id727887804"}, "name":{"label":"gahdicirb"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-12T09:49:17-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"164"}, "id":{"label":"13625762849"}, "title":{"label":"App is good for accountability. Customer support is horrendous!"}, "content":{"label":"I didn’t realize that this app didn’t include any third-party blocking functionality for devices. As soon as I realized this, I tried submitting a refund request just minutes after creating my account. I was told the only way of requesting the refund was through Apple and they denied my request twice in a row even after explaining that I had to choose a subscription type before it even told me what all was included with the service. Very frustrated with this process!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id851222104"}, "name":{"label":"patrickstar89"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-12T04:13:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"164"}, "id":{"label":"13624723457"}, "title":{"label":"Terrible Customer Service"}, "content":{"label":"Save yourself the money. I paid for a lifetime membership and still continued to be charge a monthly rate. I reached out for a refund and the App Store denied me saying “I was not eligible.” Apparently being scammed and over charged is not a qualification for a refund.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
